# Source host -> redirect target, one per line. 'delay_seconds' is a
# reserved directive key (countdown length), not a host mapping.
# Baked into the image as the built-in fallback; overridden when a
# deployment mounts a mappings.env at a higher-precedence path (see README).
# Empty by default — add entries or mount an override to enable redirects.
# delay_seconds=5
# oldapp.example.com=https://newapp.example.com/
